\"))))\n'\"","aggregated_output":"old-1 one_line 0 []\nold-1 quote 0 []\nold-1 question 0 []\nmissing distinct items 0\nsource prefixes Counter({'gnews': 1171, 'nvblog': 29, 'nvidianews': 12, 'edgar': 7, 'extra': 3, 'truenorth': 1})\nsample titles [('edgar:NVDA:0001045810-26-000078:nvda-20260902.htm', 'NVDA 8-K 8-K'), ('edgar:NVDA:0001045810-26-000075:nvda-20260726.htm', 'NVDA 10-Q 10-Q')] [('nvidianews:nvidia-partners-with-apollo-blackrock-blackstone-brookfield-goldman-sachs-and-kkr-to-establish-ai-compute-infrastructure', 'NVIDIA Partners With Apollo, BlackRock, Blackstone, Brookfield, Goldman Sachs and KKR to Establish AI Compute Infrastructure Financing Platforms to Mobilize Over $500 Billion of Third-Party Capital | '), ('nvblog:uk-air-pollution-research-earth-2', 'University of Manchester Uses NVIDIA Earth-2 to Forecast Air Pollution Across the UK | NVIDIA Blog')]\nbad original who []\nold-2 one_line 0 []\nold-2 quote 0 []\nold-2 question 0 []\nmissing distinct items 0\nsource prefixes Counter({'gnews': 1183, 'nvblog': 33, 'nvidianews': 14, 'edgar': 7, 'extra': 3, 'truenorth': 1})\nsample titles [('edgar:NVDA:0001045810-26-000078:nvda-20260902.htm', 'NVDA 8-K 8-K'), ('edgar:NVDA:0001045810-26-000075:nvda-20260726.htm', 'NVDA 10-Q 10-Q')] [('nvidianews:nvidia-partners-with-apollo-blackrock-blackstone-brookfield-goldman-sachs-and-kkr-to-establish-ai-compute-infrastructure', 'NVIDIA Partners With Apollo, BlackRock, Blackstone, Brookfield, Goldman Sachs and KKR to Establish AI Compute Infrastructure Financing Platforms to Mobilize Over $500 Billion of Third-Party Capital | '), ('nvblog:uk-air-pollution-research-earth-2', 'University of Manchester Uses NVIDIA Earth-2 to Forecast Air Pollution Across the UK | NVIDIA Blog')]\nbad original who []\nold-3 one_line 0 []\nold-3 quote 1 [('e4876', 'The revenue opportunity Nvidia sees per gigawatt of capacity is climbing a ladder of its own.')]\nold-3 question 0 []\nmissing distinct items 0\nsource prefixes Counter({'gnews'